  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">File exists at `src/client/webresources/js/sprk_fieldmapping_push.js`.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`grep -c 'ns.VERSION = "1.0.0"' src/client/webresources/js/sprk_fieldmapping_push.js` returns 1.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Two exported functions: `Spaarke.FieldMapping.Push.hasSourceProfile` and `Spaarke.FieldMapping.Push.pushUpdates` (grep confirms both).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Over-limit toast wording matches FR-B3-04 verbatim (grep confirms `"Too many related records to push interactively"` and `"Contact your administrator to run the batch cascade job."`).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">JS syntax valid (no ParseError; `node --check` exits 0 if available).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Per-target BFF calls run sequentially (no `Promise.all` over the targets array); aggregate summary produced.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`hasSourceProfile` caches per-session (grep for `sessionStorage` returns at least 2 hits: get + set).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Auth path either implemented OR decision documented in `notes/wave-6-auth-decision.md` with escalation to owner.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`/code-review` and `/adr-check` pass at Step 9.5 (or findings addressed / escalated per CLAUDE.md §6.5).</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
</task>
